  "description": "dotnet new template for Portico, the contract-first CLI framework for .NET. The \"dotnet new portico-cli\" command scaffolds a runnable net8.0 or net10.0 command-line application with an attributed route, a documented example, and passing contract tests that run that example through the real dispatch pipeline. The point is the loop: the example cannot drift from the CLI you shipped without turning a test red.",
